00:17:36.398 --> 00:17:39.330
well informed in taking
the right decision.

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:44.238
Sometimes you provide parallels from
other markets you can show what's

00:17:44.238 --> 00:17:49.146
going on in US or China, and how
