00:25:19.000 --> 00:25:19.909
or Takealot.

00:25:19.909 --> 00:25:24.724
Or any other, platform or modern,
brick and mortar retail and so on and so

00:25:24.724 --> 00:25:28.545
forth, all of that like I said
earlier just 2 to 5% max.

00:25:28.545 --> 00:25:31.777
The real competition is
the informal market and

00:25:31.777 --> 00:25:36.640
