00:27:59.695 --> 00:28:04.671
We always talk about the fact that
when you're ordering online that many

00:28:04.671 --> 00:28:07.699
things will provide the items for
BBQ seed.

00:28:07.699 --> 00:28:12.559
You can see the sellers score, you can
make decisions between multiple options,

00:28:12.559 --> 00:28:15.602
